msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid "Sets the zoom level on the Gantt chart. 'Hour' shows a range of several hours, 'Day' shows a range of a few days, 'Week' shows a range of a few months, and 'Month' shows a range of a few years, while 'Automatic' selects the range most appropriate for the current event or to-do."
msgstr "Leggt de Ansichtgrött för dat Gantt-Diagramm fast. \"Stünnen\" wiest en Reeg vun Stünnen, \"Daag\" en poor Daag, \"Weken\" un \"Maanden\" wiest en Reeg Weken oder Maanden. \"Automaatsch\" leggt dat Tietrebeet na den aktuellen Indrag fast."

